{"date":"2015-11-02","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/5a/78/163473_MGKxT.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/5a/78/163473_MGKxT.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/5a/78/163473_MGKxT.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/5a/78/163473_MGKxT.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/5a/78/163473_MGKxT.jpg"},"summary":"四百年前的嘉定古城，积雪未融，寒风凛冽。但在这深冬的尽头，春天带来了暖暖的气息。村中的各个角落里响起了爆竹声，小孩子们在自家门口玩耍，大人们则忙着新桃换旧符，迎接新一年的到来。过了三十是初一，一大早，嘉定名士唐时升端坐家中，而远迩学子相继赶到唐家，向老师拜年。老人不在乎来客的富贵与贫寒，只拿出自家所种的菜做成了贺年羹，让他们品尝着这个最朴素的味道。\r\n\r\n时至今日，人们早已忘记传统新年的点点滴滴。而借着这部短片，让我们得以一窥数百年前的浓浓人情与义理……","name":"元日","name_cn":"","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":122,"total_cont":0},{"name":"国产","count":107,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2015","count":63,"total_cont":0},{"name":"WEB","count":47,"total_cont":0},{"name":"中国唱诗班","count":46,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":38,"total_cont":0},{"name":"璀璨星空","count":18,"total_cont":0},{"name":"彭擎政","count":17,"total_cont":0},{"name":"中国","count":16,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画短片","count":13,"total_cont":0},{"name":"独立动画","count":9,"total_cont":0},{"name":"中国动画","count":9,"total_cont":0},{"name":"俞江","count":8,"total_cont":0},{"name":"古风","count":7,"total_cont":0},{"name":"国产动画","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"历史","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"袁国庆","count":4,"total_cont":0},{"name":"治愈","count":4,"total_cont":0},{"name":"李夏恩","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"短篇","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"OVA","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"徐慧","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"剧情","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2015年","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2010s","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"9+","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"华语","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"浪漫","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"传统","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"中国唱诗班之元日"}]},{"key":"话数","value":"1"},{"key":"放送开始","value":"2015年11月2日"},{